1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,460
The AI Navigator knows the whole app, your watchlist, your Groups, Sets and funnels,

2
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:05,740
and today's Tides.

3
00:00:06,189 --> 00:00:08,721
It slides out from the right edge, on every page,

4
00:00:08,741 --> 00:00:11,332
so the page you're working on stays in view.

5
00:00:15,662 --> 00:00:17,861
Ask anything in your own words.

6
00:00:17,911 --> 00:00:21,453
Here: how do I find coins that are dipping inside an uptrend?

7
00:00:23,991 --> 00:00:28,686
It answers from the app's own readings and help, never from guesses about prices.

8
00:00:46,456 --> 00:00:49,231
The answer walks you through it, step by step.

9
00:00:49,281 --> 00:00:52,397
It points to the right place, and the right training video.

10
00:00:52,838 --> 00:00:56,381
You can also paste a screenshot, and ask what you're looking at.

11
00:00:56,835 --> 00:00:58,884
Close it with the same handle.

12
00:00:58,934 --> 00:01:01,666
The conversation is kept for when you come back.
